From e990e17a2839d627ee9a64320842556a749a6fa5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gee <gehee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:53:38 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] h265d: decode a picture as its slices arrive (fpvOS 0002,
 ported to 14729dd5)

Ported from the GS image spike's HermanChen-develop port
(sbc-groundstations-gilankpam 5dffa21) to rockchip-linux/mpp 14729dd5:
parser hunks moved to the rewritten h265 parser (h265d_api.c h265d_prepare,
h265d_ctx.h H265dPrs, h265d_syntax.c h265d_syntax_fill_slice); vdpu34x
names Vdpu34xRegSet, comm_gen, comm_paras.reg64.stream_mode/stream_lastpacket,
reg_ctx->cfg->dev, reg_ctx->cfg->frame_slots; designated-initializer
MppDevApi tables. No logic change.
